WEBVTT

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:00.970
Lempicka.

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:07.080
Kazuki!

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:09.240
Oh no.
 Let's hurry.

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:55.820
Kazuki!

00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:57.260
Kazuki!

00:02:58.790 --> 00:03:00.060
Kazuki!

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:07.190
Kazuki, I told you over and over
not to leave your room.

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:08.680
I'm sorry.

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:09.840
Listen to me.

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:12.500
You are not to go anywhere.

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:14.570
Not you...

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:25.280
Souseiseki

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:28.150
Vacuum suction using special cups...

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:31.000
Add 6 centimeters to your bust, huh?

00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:34.660
The ribbon is crooked.

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:38.220
It's getting a bit easier on the eyes.

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:39.760
Hey, quiet down.

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:41.630
What have you guys been...

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:46.240
You three!

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:49.320
After all the trouble we went through
to make it look gorgeous.

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:54.960
Hold it!

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:57.500
He went after Shinku.

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:59.930
He is so darn hopeless.

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:02.360
Even his thoughts are puny.

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:07.770
The N Field?

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:12.520
Oh, Hina-Ichigo, don't 
approach it so carelessly!

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:14.760
Hina-Ichigo!

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:17.530
What is this?

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:22.910
Kazuki, I'll be going out for a bit.

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:25.080
Be good and wait.

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:26.870
All right.

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:28.600
Oh, Souseiseki!

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:28.600
Take care.

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:29.820
I swear.

00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:32.110
"Kazuki, Kazuki," from 
morning till night.

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:35.440
Talk about a one-trick whatchamacallit.

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:39.890
Let's wash our hands
of that bothersome old man.

00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:41.780
Let's look for another master...

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:43.350
Don't badmouth him.

00:04:43.350 --> 00:04:46.520
Souseiseki, something's wrong with him!

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:49.630
Nothing good will come of staying here.

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:49.270
S-Stop it...

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:51.500
I...

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:54.860
...can't go with you.

00:04:56.580 --> 00:04:59.790
Suiseiseki... Goodbye.

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:02.170
Sto... Stop it...

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:04.930
Stop, Souseiseki!

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:07.960
There you are!

00:05:07.960 --> 00:05:09.710
Unhand me, Jun!

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:16.430
Gotcha, you rotten doll.

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:21.520
Suiseiseki?

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:25.690
Guess what? Guess what?
 Just now...

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:30.360
Nothing.

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:32.870
What was that about?

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:40.370
It should last another ten years.

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:42.200
I'm so glad.

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:44.300
This clock 
means a lot to me.

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:46.140
Oh, that reminds me.

00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:48.980
Gramps, if you'd like these...

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:52.950
Oh, taro tumbled in soy sauce.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:55.460
I made too much,
 so I thought I'd share.

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:57.230
Thank you.

00:05:57.230 --> 00:05:58.970
My son loves this dish.

00:05:58.970 --> 00:05:59.860
He'll be so happy.

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:03.360
Um, well...

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:14.740
I wonder what's happened 
to old Shibasaki...

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:16.920
His son is...

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:18.640
He talked about that again?

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:20.970
With his wife's state...

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:22.070
Oh, I'm going to be late!

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:22.750
He's getting old...

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:24.480
But he's still skilled.

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:24.480
S-Sakurada-san...

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:25.950
Oh, was he able to fix it?

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:27.270
T-Too fast...

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:30.870
Cabbage has been pricey lately.

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:31.620
I know!

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:44.720
Kazuki.

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:46.810
You must be hungry.

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:48.880
I received a stewed dish today.

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:50.790
From Kato-san from block two.

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:53.010
I'll go warm it up for you.

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:57.370
Up we go.

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:24.070
Suigintou!

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:31.200
You have it rough.

00:07:31.530 --> 00:07:34.230
Playing the replacement 
for a lost son...

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:38.140
You have no feminine charm after all.

00:07:39.780 --> 00:07:42.160
It's useless to look for 
the old woman's tree.

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:45.660
It was all white and empty, right?

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:49.670
Even if you found it, your shears
wouldn't be up to the task.

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:51.140
Right?

00:07:51.390 --> 00:07:55.770
Suiseiseki, a gardener like you,
has the watering can you need.

00:07:57.960 --> 00:08:02.360
Say, would you like me to steal it
from Suiseiseki for you?

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:03.280
Steal?

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:05.780
You need it, don't you?

00:08:06.190 --> 00:08:08.380
Suigintou, you don't mean...

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:16.390
Okay, everyone!

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:19.390
Here are your
flower-topped hamburger steaks!

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:20.910
Yay!

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:25.040
You'll get tired of having it so often.

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:27.810
Hina wants flower-topped all the time!

00:08:27.810 --> 00:08:29.500
Tomorrow and tomorrow's tomorrow!

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:31.240
"The day after".

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:32.240
The day after!

00:08:32.520 --> 00:08:34.480
Now, help yourselves!

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:36.940
Thanks for the food!

00:08:40.110 --> 00:08:42.910
Suiseiseki-chan, aren't you hungry?

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:47.860
Then this should really 
be for after dinner...

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:50.290
Here, today's special treat.

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:51.730
Wow!

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:56.740
You know, it's been Hina's dream
to have juice at dinner time!

00:08:56.740 --> 00:08:58.460
Juice! Juice!

00:08:58.460 --> 00:08:59.970
You can later.

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:01.820
Juice! Juice! Juice!

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:03.260
Settle down.

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:10.050
Suiseiseki, you...

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:12.330
I'm going to sleep.

00:09:15.470 --> 00:09:17.660
Suiseiseki-chan, what's wrong?

00:09:21.770 --> 00:09:23.260
What's with her?

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:27.430
Hina-Ichigo, something happened
in the storage room.

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:30.550
Um, nothing happened.

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:33.490
Nothing like Souseiseki
showing up in the mirror...

00:09:34.810 --> 00:09:35.900
Souseiseki?

00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:37.650
No! No!

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:39.910
Hey, what's this "Souseiseki"?

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:44.910
Souseiseki...

00:09:45.220 --> 00:09:48.910
Suiseiseki's younger twin sister
who wields the gardener's shears.

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:52.660
In every era,
 they've been together

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:54.560
so I thought it was strange, but...

00:09:55.930 --> 00:09:59.680
It appears Suiseiseki 
is hiding something.

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:25.720
That's enough, Suigintou!

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:28.290
Is the secret out?

00:10:28.570 --> 00:10:32.020
You're about the only 
one who'd stoop so low!

00:10:32.630 --> 00:10:34.720
Don't scowl at me like that.

00:10:34.890 --> 00:10:38.870
I came all this way to show you
something you'll want to see.

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:42.510
Souseiseki!

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:44.060
Poor thing.

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:46.610
Not even allowed to sleep in her case.

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:50.160
And after forsaking you for her master.

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:51.640
Why?

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:55.340
That old man liked Souseiseki!

00:10:56.240 --> 00:10:58.650
I suppose it's what's called 
a love gone too far.

00:11:02.770 --> 00:11:08.140
Dreaming in the case holds
special meaning for us.

00:11:08.380 --> 00:11:12.930
A sacred ritual that spins our
nearly eternal past into the present.

00:11:14.530 --> 00:11:16.400
Robbed of that...

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:21.340
...she may eventually become just
an empty shell devoid of emotion.

00:11:22.970 --> 00:11:25.220
Kazuki...

00:11:25.640 --> 00:11:27.010
Souseiseki!

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:34.920
Such a caring elder sister, Suiseiseki.

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:36.220
Admirable.

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:37.250
Most admirable.

00:12:09.980 --> 00:12:11.450
Suiseiseki?

00:12:14.940 --> 00:12:16.480
Souseiseki.

00:12:17.890 --> 00:12:20.730
Why are you...

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:28.130
Nothing has changed.

00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:34.490
It's fine.

00:12:34.490 --> 00:12:35.620
Leave it.

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:36.960
Souseiseki?

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:40.080
There's something I have to do.

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:43.300
If I don't, master's heart 
and mind will be broken.

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:46.460
He was broken long ago.

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:49.130
She's been sleeping all this time.

00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:53.160
Her dreams were all white
and empty when we went in.

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:54.800
Give this up already!

00:12:56.640 --> 00:12:59.060
I want you to use
 your power to help me.

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:04.270
I know I'm not in any 
position to ask, but...

00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:07.710
You want me to use the 
watering can for him?

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:09.280
Please.

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:13.010
Even though he treats you like this...

00:13:13.590 --> 00:13:15.980
you'd still take the side 
of that senile old man?

00:13:18.220 --> 00:13:20.150
Snap out of it already!

00:13:21.790 --> 00:13:23.020
Kazuki!

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:28.210
Kazuki?

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:29.590
Kazuki!

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:31.610
Suiseiseki?

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:33.020
Hurry!

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:35.230
Come!

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:37.060
Kazuki!

00:13:48.130 --> 00:13:49.020
Ka...

00:14:06.100 --> 00:14:07.510
Kazuki...

00:14:16.690 --> 00:14:18.640
Why are you so obsessed with him?

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:24.880
Come with me to Jun.

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:25.880
Jun?

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:29.020
Is that your new master?

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:33.570
We've yet to enter into 
a covenant, but...

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:34.890
But?

00:14:35.090 --> 00:14:37.680
He's an utterly hopeless runt.

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:41.730
I worry about how he'll manage
if I'm not around...

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:43.840
So he's a good person.

00:14:44.140 --> 00:14:44.870
Do you like him?

00:14:45.210 --> 00:14:47.190
W-What are you saying?

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:51.900
It's just that he's far and away
better than that lousy old man!

00:14:51.900 --> 00:14:54.840
Besides, Shinku and 
Hina-Ichigo are there too.

00:14:56.050 --> 00:14:57.160
Shinku...

00:14:57.320 --> 00:14:58.440
Hina-Ichigo...

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:01.070
That brings back memories.

00:15:02.850 --> 00:15:03.950
I know!

00:15:04.240 --> 00:15:08.360
You should enter into
a covenant with Jun too, then...

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:10.240
Kazuki!

00:15:10.390 --> 00:15:12.050
Kazuki!

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:13.850
Kazuki!

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:15.130
Kazuki!

00:15:15.410 --> 00:15:18.170
Master's worried about me.

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:20.370
Kazuki!

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:23.590
Quit crying in that frightful manner!

00:15:23.590 --> 00:15:26.280
I'll turn you into roast chicken!

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:27.970
Kazuki!

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:32.990
I'm still going back.

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:34.380
Souseiseki!

00:15:34.380 --> 00:15:37.160
I feel the same way as you do.

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:40.490
I want to be by my master's side.

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:44.240
You're so smitten with the elderly!

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:46.500
My patience has so run out!

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:49.460
Sui Dream!

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:54.330
As your elder twin sister,

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:57.590
I'll return you
to the right path, even by force!

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:06.540
Lempicka!

00:16:09.930 --> 00:16:11.580
Stop this, Suiseiseki!

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:15.680
I have no intention of fighting you...

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:27.070
Suiseiseki...

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:49.860
Kazuki!

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:53.860
Sorry, I'm not the boyish type.

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:55.260
You're...

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:02.230
No matter how you cherish her,
she will flee from your side.

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:06.240
You will be eternally alone.

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:07.720
Why you!

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:13.450
You shouldn't get angry.

00:17:13.450 --> 00:17:15.570
Your blood pressure
will go up.

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:17.980
Have you taken your 
lactic acid bacteria?

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:22.420
Kazuki...

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:25.430
There is just one way.

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:30.230
A way to keep that girl
bound to your side forever.

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:34.820
Will you help me, gramps?

00:17:44.630 --> 00:17:47.980
Souseiseki, come back with me.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:51.710
I don't want to hurt you any more!

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:58.020
Is that old man that precious to you?

00:17:58.470 --> 00:17:59.450
More than me?

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:15.360
Souseiseki, you...

00:18:15.580 --> 00:18:19.770
Souseiseki, you dummy!

00:18:36.560 --> 00:18:37.700
Sorry...

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:04.850
Master...

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:10.820
I'm sorry.

00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:15.060
Kazuki...

00:19:15.760 --> 00:19:17.270
Uh, um...

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:33.020
Kazuki...

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:38.370
Kazuki...

00:19:58.220 --> 00:19:59.370
Bathroom...

00:20:04.190 --> 00:20:05.650
Suiseiseki?

00:20:05.900 --> 00:20:08.640
Hey, what are you doing 
this late at night?

00:20:14.930 --> 00:20:17.560
Hey, does it hurt somewhere, Suisei...

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:18.360
You!

00:20:21.910 --> 00:20:23.420
Why you!

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:27.550
If only you were cooler 
and more dependable...

00:20:27.550 --> 00:20:31.730
Souseiseki wouldn't choose that
senile old man over you!

00:20:32.110 --> 00:20:33.610
What's this about?

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:37.700
What's the matter?

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:40.240
It's morning...

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:45.600
Jun.

00:20:46.530 --> 00:20:49.490
What did you do to Suiseiseki?

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:51.240
What are you talking about?

00:20:51.240 --> 00:20:53.640
I was just going
 to the bathroom!

00:20:53.970 --> 00:20:55.200
I wonder...

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:57.220
Suiseiseki, are you okay?

00:20:57.220 --> 00:20:58.730
I didn't do anything!

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:11.040
You...

00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:16.430
What's wrong?

00:21:16.430 --> 00:21:17.910
Suiseiseki?

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:22.780
A doorway to dreams
is being opened somewhere.

00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:25.560
Doorway to dreams?

00:21:26.110 --> 00:21:28.800
There's someone else
 that can open them?

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:31.190
Is that...

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:38.130
Souseiseki, what are you doing?

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:43.000
I swear!

00:23:43.000 --> 00:23:45.620
How much worry
must you put me through?

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:48.650
Suiseiseki, stop bothering with me.

00:23:48.650 --> 00:23:50.930
W-What did you say?

00:23:50.930 --> 00:23:55.930
Why should only you be run ragged
for that old man's sake?

00:23:55.930 --> 00:23:57.480
You'll understand someday too.

00:23:57.480 --> 00:24:00.170
No, maybe you already do.

00:24:00.170 --> 00:24:03.070
Like hell I'll ever understand that!

00:24:03.070 --> 00:24:05.070
Next time on Rozen Maiden...

00:24:05.070 --> 00:24:08.140
Swear on this rose ring, you!

00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:10.910
Chapter 9
Cage
